class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"primarytype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Demon Overlords</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"spawntype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Spawn Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"isboss\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rank</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Boss</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illusionable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illusionable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pushable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pushable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pushobjects\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pushes</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Immunity Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"paraimmune\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Paralysable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"senseinvis\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sense Invis</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"question-tick\" title=\"Unknown\">?</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20220627012226&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Samael_595715.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  Samael.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>AAARRRRRRRR! YOU WILL PAY SO DEARLY FOR THIS!</li><li>ARE YOU INSANE TRYING TO TRAP ME HERE?!</li><li>I'M THE LORD OF ALL LORDS! LET ME OUT OF HERE!</li><li>I HATE YOU ALL!</li><li>JUST YOU WAIT FOR ME.</li><li>RAHHHH!</li><li>THIS PUNY PRISON WILL NEVER HOLD ME!</li><li>WHEN I GET OUT OF HERE....</li><li>YOU CALLED ME, NOW YOU WILL TAKE RESPONSIBILITY.</li><li>YOU HAVE NO IDEA WHAT YOU'VE DONE.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Samael managed to switch worlds during a small ritual performed by <a href=\"#/wiki/Eclesius\">Eclesius</a> to help his former assistant, Turian, who is now transformed into a frog. While Samael was bewildered right after entering our world, Eclesius managed to lock him up in a cage located under Eclesius' home. Keeping Samael's cage locked and in good shape is needed to \"prevent the apocalypse\", according to Eclesius who refers to him as a <i>Demon Uberoverlord</i>.<br/>\nIts name is confirmed by his fellow inmate <a href=\"#/wiki/A%20Confused%20Frog\">A Confused Frog</a> who describes Samael as an annoyed Demon Overlord.<br/>\nIt is not possible to see Samael from any known place in Tibia, however it is possible to hear his screams from <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32293,32293,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">outside his cellar (32293, 32293, 9)</a>, from <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32304,32260,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">this cave in Thais sewers (32304, 32260, 9)</a> and from <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32327,32274,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Thais prison (32327, 32274, 9)</a>.<br/>\nAlthough some players believe it might be possible to reach and face Samael, there is no sustainable evidence that points the devs ever intended to make it possible for players to reach Samael.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"47eade23f58d7e7b78992e17aa07c8bb\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:192px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:145px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Samael-s_Cellar-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:143px; width:190px;\"><img alt=\"Samael is located after the bars inside the locked cellar, one map field to the east of what can be seen in this image\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Samael is located after the bars inside the locked cellar, one map field to the east of what can be seen in this image\" height=\"143\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Samael_s_Cellar_666433.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Samael's Cellar.png (2.3 MB)\" width=\"190\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:190px;\">Samael is located after the bars inside the locked cellar, one map field to the east of what can be seen in this image</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:192px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:145px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Samael-s_Team_Finder-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:137px; width:190px; top:3px;\"><img alt=\"Samael can be seen in the Team Finder's boss list\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Samael can be seen in the 's boss list\" height=\"143\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Samael_s_Team_Finder_a67503.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Samael's Team Finder.png (173 KB)\" width=\"190\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:190px;\">Samael can be seen in the Team Finder's boss list</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\">Unknown.</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-creature-resistance-table\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Damage_Taken_From_Elements\">Damage Taken From Elements</span></h3>\n<div id=\"w-creature-resistance-d\">\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Physical\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Physical <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Bestiary Physical Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bestiary_Physical_Icon_Big_83da43.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\