ss=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tUnknown.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>With the implementation of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Bosstiary</a> and the Daily Boosted Boss in the Summer Update 2022 it was possible to confirm the appearance of Samael. The appearance has been leaked before on social media but the data from the new feature was the first official source for it.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Demon_Overlords\">Demon Overlords</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><p class=\"no-results\">There are no results matching these parameters.</p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[]}